          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>Sheryl M. · Kickstarter backer</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="spooky__quote">
          <blockquote>
            “Incredibly rewarding and proud of finishing a project, because
            I struggle with finishing projects.”
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>Timothy K. · Kickstarter backer</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="spooky__quote">
          <blockquote>
            “It was easy, relaxing, and fun. I immediately wanted to do another.”
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>Megan D. · got hers as a gift</figcaption>
        </figure>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    PROOF STRIP
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

