    <div class="spooky__proof-grid spooky__shell">

      <div class="spooky__proof-item">
        <strong>2,013</strong>
        <span>Kickstarter backers</span>
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__proof-item">
        <strong>$158K</strong>
        <span>raised</span>
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__proof-item">
        <strong>9 of 9</strong>
        <span>finishers surveyed would recommend it</span>
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__proof-item spooky__proof-item--quote">
        <strong>“Disconnecting from everyday stressors.”</strong>
        <span>Jessica P. · made one of her grandson</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    PET PORTRAIT FEATURE
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__section spooky__section--smoke">
    <div class="spooky__shell spooky__split">

      <div class="spooky__media-card">
        {% if section.settings.pet_image != blank %}
          {{
            section.settings.pet_image
            | image_url: width: 1500
            | image_tag:
              class: 'spooky__product-image',
              loading: 'lazy',
              widths: '500, 800, 1100, 1500',
              sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 48vw, 100vw',
              alt: section.settings.pet_image.alt
          }}
        {% else %}
          <div class="spooky__placeholder">
            {{ 'lifestyle-2' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <span>Pet portrait in thread · 1500 x 1875</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__section-copy">
        <p class="spooky__eyebrow spooky__eyebrow--pumpkin">Pet portrait</p>
        <h2 class="spooky__h2 spooky__h2--light">The most photographed member of the family. Framed.</h2>
        <p class="spooky__lead">
          Thread makes a portrait that's a little eerie in the best way. The eyes come through first, then the rest of the face, line by line.
        </p>
        <p class="spooky__ritual-line">Use the photo you already have. Your dog does not need to sit still.</p>
        <a class="spooky__button spooky__button--primary" href="{{ cta_url }}" data-spooky-cta>
          Thread your pet
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    ONE FOR YOU / ONE FOR THEM
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__section spooky__section--bone">
    <div class="spooky__shell">

      <div class="spooky__section-heading">
        <p class="spooky__eyebrow">Buy one kit, second kit 50% off</p>
        <h2 class="spooky__h2">
          One for you. One for them.
        </h2>
        <p>
          Two kits, two photos. They don't have to match, and they don't have to be for the same person.
          The second kit is 50% off all month.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__pair">

        <article class="spooky__pair-card spooky__pair-card--make">
          <span class="spooky__pair-index">01</span>
          <h3>One for you.</h3>
          <p class="spooky__pair-lead">
            Black thread, dark wall, one candle. October threading hits different.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>The app reads each line out loud. Your eyes stay on the loom.</li>
            <li>Stop whenever. Your place is saved.</li>
            <li>Five to eight hours, spread across however many evenings you like.</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="spooky__button spooky__button--black" href="{{ cta_url }}" data-spooky-cta>
            Make yours
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="spooky__pair-card spooky__pair-card--give">
          <span class="spooky__pair-index">02</span>
          <h3>One for them.</h3>
          <p class="spooky__pair-lead">
            Their dog. Their grandmother. The two of you, ten years ago. A gift they make with their own hands, in time for December.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Every kit works with any photo. Nothing to pre-order or customize.</li>
            <li>Birthdays are coming. So is the holiday list.</li>
            <li>Second kit 50% off, through October 31.</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="spooky__button spooky__button--primary" href="{{ cta_url }}" data-spooky-cta>
            Give one
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    HOW IT WORKS
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__section spooky__section--black">
    <div class="spooky__shell">

      <div class="spooky__section-heading">
        <p class="spooky__eyebrow spooky__eyebrow--pumpkin">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="spooky__h2 spooky__h2--light">
          From camera roll to wall.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__steps">

        <article class="spooky__step">
          <div class="spooky__step-media">
            {% if section.settings.step1_image != blank %}
              {{
                section.settings.step1_image
                | image_url: width: 1000
                | image_tag:
                  loading: 'lazy',
                  widths: '400, 700, 1000',
                  sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 33vw, 100vw',
                  alt: section.settings.step1_image.alt
              }}
            {% else %}
              <div class="spooky__placeholder">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                <span>App upload screen</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Upload a photo</h3>
          <p>Any photo from your camera roll. The app turns it into a threading sequence.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="spooky__step">
          <div class="spooky__step-media">
            {% if section.settings.step2_image != blank %}
              {{
                section.settings.step2_image
                | image_url: width: 1000
                | image_tag:
                  loading: 'lazy',
                  widths: '400, 700, 1000',
                  sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 33vw, 100vw',
                  alt: section.settings.step2_image.alt
              }}
            {% else %}
              <div class="spooky__placeholder">
                {{ 'lifestyle-2' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                <span>Hands threading</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Follow the voice</h3>
          <p>It tells you where to go next, line by line, at your pace. No counting.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="spooky__step">
          <div class="spooky__step-media">
            {% if section.settings.step3_image != blank %}
              {{
                section.settings.step3_image
                | image_url: width: 1000
                | image_tag:
                  loading: 'lazy',
                  widths: '400, 700, 1000',
                  sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 33vw, 100vw',
                  alt: section.settings.step3_image.alt
              }}
            {% else %}
              <div class="spooky__placeholder">
                {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                <span>Finished piece on a wall</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Hang your piece</h3>
          <p>Your photo, made in thread. On the wall by Halloween, or whenever.</p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    THE KIT + THE MATH
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__section spooky__section--bone">
    <div class="spooky__shell spooky__split">

      <div class="spooky__media-card">
        {% if section.settings.product_image != blank %}
          {{
            section.settings.product_image
            | image_url: width: 1500
            | image_tag:
              class: 'spooky__product-image',
              loading: 'lazy',
              widths: '500, 800, 1100, 1500',
              sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 48vw, 100vw',
              alt: section.settings.product_image.alt
          }}
        {% else %}
          <div class="spooky__placeholder">
            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <span>Kit contents flat lay</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__section-copy">
        <p class="spooky__eyebrow">What's in the box</p>
        <h2 class="spooky__h2">Everything. Twice.</h2>
        <p class="spooky__lead">
          Each kit is complete on its own. Two kits, two full sets, nothing shared.
        </p>

        <ul class="spooky__contents">
          <li>Loom and mounting hardware</li>
          <li>Thread, spool holder, threading tool</li>
          <li>Numbered guide and wooden phone stand</li>
