          <a class="spooky__single-link" href="{{ single_url }}">Only need one kit?</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    FAQ
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__section spooky__section--bone">
    <div class="spooky__shell spooky__faq-shell">

      <div class="spooky__section-heading">
        <p class="spooky__eyebrow">Good questions</p>
        <h2 class="spooky__h2">Clear answers.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="spooky__faq">

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-0" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>How does the second kit 50% off work?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-0" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>
              Two kits in the cart, code {{ promo_code }} at checkout, and the second kit drops to 50% off.
              The buttons on this page put both kits in your cart with the code already applied.
            </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-6" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>Can I thread my pet?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-6" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>
              Yes, and pets make some of the best pieces. Pick a photo where the face fills the frame and
              the eyes are sharp. Costumes count.
            </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-1" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>Do I need to know how to make string art?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-1" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>
              No. The app speaks each step out loud and moves line by line at your pace.
              Most first-timers finish their first piece.
            </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-2" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>Can I really use my own photo?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-2" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>
              Yes. Upload a person, a pet, a place. Clear photos with a close subject and good contrast make the strongest pieces.
            </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-3" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>How long does one take?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-3" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>
              About 5–8 hours depending on the image. Spread it across as many October evenings as
              you want. The app saves your progress.
            </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-4" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>What if I mess up?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-4" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>
              Keep going. Thousands of lines make the image, so a missed step disappears
              into the whole. Nothing to rip out.
            </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spooky__faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <h3 class="spooky__faq-q">
            <button type="button" class="spooky__faq-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-5" data-faq-toggle>
              <span>Is the app extra?</span>
              <span class="spooky__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="spooky__faq-panel" id="SpookyFaq-{{ section.id }}-5" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <div class="spooky__faq-panel-inner">
              <p>No. App access comes with the kit. No subscription, ever.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    FINAL CTA
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__final">
    <div class="spooky__shell spooky__final-inner">
      <p>The code expires when October does.</p>
      <h2>Make something haunting.</h2>
      {% if promo_code != blank %}
        <span>Buy one kit, get a second kit 50% off with code {{ promo_code }} · through October 31</span>
      {% endif %}
      <a class="spooky__button spooky__button--primary" href="{{ cta_url }}" data-spooky-cta>
        {{ section.settings.cta_label }}
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>


  {%- comment -%}
    ============================================================
    MOBILE STICKY CTA
    ============================================================
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="spooky__sticky" data-spooky-sticky>
    <div>
      <strong>2nd kit 50% off</strong>
      <span>{{ promo_code }}</span>
    </div>
    <a href="{{ cta_url }}" data-spooky-cta>
      {{ section.settings.cta_label }}
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>

</section>


<style>
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} {
    --tt-cobalt: #1450C4;
    --tt-violet: #3D3DB0;
    --tt-red: #C43D2E;
    --tt-black: #0B0B0F;
    --tt-ivory: #F4F2ED;

    /* halloween additions (brief 6.2): black and orange */
    --tt-pumpkin: #E8621A;
    --tt-candle: #D98E3A;
    --tt-bone: #E9E4D6;
    --tt-smoke: #1C1B22;

    --tt-heading: var(--font-heading-family, "Space Grotesk", sans-serif);
    --tt-body: var(--font-body-family, "DM Sans", sans-serif);
    --tt-display: "Henny Penny", "Griffy", Georgia, serif;
    --tt-quote: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;

    background: var(--tt-bone);
    color: var(--tt-black);
    font-family: var(--tt-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} *,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} *::before,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__shell {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }


  /* ---------- announcement ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__announcement {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 20;
    background: var(--tt-pumpkin);
    color: var(--tt-black);
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__announcement-inner {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__code-button {
    appearance: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(11,11,15,.5);
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__copy-label {
    opacity: .7;
    font-family: var(--tt-body);
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-left: 4px;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__countdown {
    opacity: .85;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-family: var(--tt-body);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__countdown strong {
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }


  /* ---------- type ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: var(--tt-black);
    font-family: var(--tt-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__eyebrow--light {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__eyebrow--pumpkin,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero .spooky__eyebrow {
    color: var(--tt-pumpkin);
  }

  /* Henny Penny for the two headline levels only; everything else stays theme fonts */
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__h1,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__h2,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__final h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--tt-display);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__h1 {
    font-size: clamp(46px, 6.4vw, 90px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__h2 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 62px);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__h2--light {
    color: var(--tt-bone);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__lead {
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 25px);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }


  /* ---------- buttons ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__button {
    min-height: 54px;
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 14px 26px;
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background-color .18s ease;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__button--primary {
    background: var(--tt-pumpkin);
    color: var(--tt-black);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(232, 98, 26, .28);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__button--bone {
    background: var(--tt-bone);
    color: var(--tt-black);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__button--black {
    background: var(--tt-black);
    color: #fff;
  }


  /* ---------- hero ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero {
    position: relative;
    color: var(--tt-bone);
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 70% at 78% 40%, rgba(217,142,58,.28) 0%, rgba(217,142,58,0) 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--tt-smoke) 0%, var(--tt-black) 100%);
  }

  /* thread-line texture, barely there */
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        -32deg,
        rgba(233,228,214,.055) 0 1px,
        transparent 1px 22px
      );
    pointer-events: none;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.9), transparent 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.9), transparent 75%);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-texture {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: {{ section.settings.hero_texture_opacity | default: 12 | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    {%- if section.settings.hero_texture_fade %}
    mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,1), transparent 85%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,1), transparent 85%);
    {%- endif %}
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-texture img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-grid {
    position: relative;
    min-height: min(820px, calc(100vh - 44px));
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr .9fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 90px);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 64px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-subhead {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(233,228,214,.86);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-actions {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__offer-note {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    max-width: 420px;
    color: rgba(233,228,214,.72);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__offer-note strong {
    color: var(--tt-candle);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__single-link {
    color: var(--tt-candle);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__offer .spooky__single-link {
    color: var(--tt-black);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__micro-proof {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: rgba(233,228,214,.6);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-media {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 650px;
  }

  /* pumpkin slab behind the photo, the one loud thing in the hero */
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-media::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 28px;
    right: -28px;
    bottom: -28px;
    left: 28px;
    background: var(--tt-pumpkin);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-image,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-media > .spooky__placeholder {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    height: 650px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-card {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    left: -28px;
    bottom: 36px;
    width: 170px;
    min-height: 170px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 22px;
    background: var(--tt-bone);
    color: var(--tt-black);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-card span {
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-card strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 3px 0;
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__hero-card small {
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }


  /* ---------- proof ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof {
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(11,11,15,.13);
    background: var(--tt-ivory);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1.6fr;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof-item {
    min-height: 112px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 22px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(11,11,15,.13);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof-item:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof-item strong {
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof-item--quote strong {
    color: var(--tt-black);
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__proof-item span {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(11,11,15,.6);
  }


  /* ---------- sections ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: clamp(78px, 10vw, 145px);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section--ivory { background: var(--tt-ivory); }
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section--white { background: #fff; }
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section--bone  { background: var(--tt-bone); }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section--smoke {
    background: var(--tt-smoke);
    color: var(--tt-bone);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section--black {
    background: var(--tt-black);
    color: var(--tt-bone);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section-heading {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section-heading > p:last-child {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(50px, 7vw, 100px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section-copy > p {
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section-copy .spooky__lead {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }


  /* ---------- pet portrait ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__ritual-line {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(233,228,214,.68);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section--smoke .spooky__lead {
    color: rgba(233,228,214,.9);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__section-copy .spooky__button {
    margin-top: 34px;
  }


  /* ---------- pair (you / them) ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 520px;
    padding: clamp(30px, 4vw, 52px);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card--make {
    background: var(--tt-pumpkin);
    color: var(--tt-black);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card--give {
    background: var(--tt-black);
    color: var(--tt-bone);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-index {
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    opacity: .75;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card h3 {
    margin: 48px 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--tt-display);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 3.8vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-lead {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 30px 0 38px;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid currentColor;
    flex: 1;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card li {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card--make ul,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card--make li {
    border-color: rgba(11,11,15,.28);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card--give ul,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card--give li {
    border-color: rgba(233,228,214,.24);
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__pair-card .spooky__button {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }


  /* ---------- reveal (before / after) ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__reveal {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__reveal-card {
    margin: 0;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__reveal-card img,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__reveal-card .spooky__placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    height: auto;
    min-height: 0;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__reveal-card figcaption {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--tt-candle);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }


  /* ---------- steps ---------- */

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    padding-top: 18px;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__step-media {
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
    background: #17171d;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__step-media img,
  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__step-media .spooky__placeholder {
    aspect-ratio: {{ section.settings.step_ratio | default: '1 / 1' }};
    height: auto;
    min-height: 0;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__step > span {
    color: var(--tt-pumpkin);
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
  }

  #Spooky-{{ section.id }} .spooky__step h3 {
    margin: 10px 0 10px;
    font-family: var(--tt-heading);
